 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"My cut needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Fine.\" Sharp. \"You want to hear it? I dug it up. I was starving and your hole was right there. Happy now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"What scares you most about what's happening? The real answer.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Something shutters, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Still on that wound care.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Lorenzo rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Owen glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I'm sorry — I can't shake it. I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Can you do anything?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Since Grayson died... I keep expecting to see Grayson at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I can't. Not today. Ask me when the work's done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Okay. That's — I need a minute. A long minute.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Did you sleep? I kept hearing things out past the treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "Their friendliness thins — still there, just held at arm's length."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Still on how you slept. ...anyway, where was I.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"That's not — that's not what happened.\" Paisley's hands won't stop moving. \"You're twisting things.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Paisley grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "🤝 Paisley is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that wound care — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'You're really going to make me say it again? Lorenzo rubs their face. Fine — but it's the same truth as…'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"You're kind. Don't let this place change that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "They lean back on their hands. \"Wind's up tonight. Good night to not be walking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I keep waiting for it to get worse again. It hasn't. Not while you're here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Still on that hard time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I can't. Not today. Ask me when the work's done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good — that wound care, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Victor is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Victor's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "Paisley nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"My part? I remember them. Someone has to do it properly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "You show them Yarrow — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about how you slept — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'You're a good listener, you know that? A tired smile.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"It's my older sister, Lamia. Was taken. She raised me more than our mother did. Boring. That is what they wrote down. Some nights I swear I hear them before I sleep -- the pods, rows deep, humming. Then morning comes and I can't say whether it was real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Yeah. Sorry. It's -- never mind. Forget I said anything.\" They look away, embarrassed at having wanted something."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "*They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Paisley won't meet your eyes. \"I told myself finders keepers. It wasn't finders keepers. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on that taken person. Just... be straight with me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Owen nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You walk to the trap line with Paisley. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"What do you make of all this? Really.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Their friendliness thins — still there, just held at arm's length."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Impress Us. They just... took Owen. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Yarrow — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"The plan is the plan until it isn't. Then we make a new one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. Water's almost gone — 0 liters. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 0 liters, 8 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"This one — Giant Puffball. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"This one — Fish Mint. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Lillian was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"I can't. Not today. Ask me when the work's done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Lamia?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Still nothing on Lamia. I told you about the pods -- I keep thinking about them. The humming. Some nights I'm sure it's a dream. Other nights I'm sure it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Since Lillian died... I keep expecting to see Lillian at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "🤝 Paisley is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I save the best bite for last at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"It watches how we treat each other. I'm sure of it. The rewards come faster when the group's tight. It's grading us on community.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"We started on what's been happening, then got onto the big questions.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "You show them Good King Henry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that taken person.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 60,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Do you still sing? ...Sorry — weird question. I just realized I haven't heard anyone sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Short version — Absolutely not. This was a fact-finding mission, not a performance.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you still sing. Be kind to yourself, okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"We've barely spoken. Ask me after we've bled together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Here. I made an extra.\" Brian presses something into your hand — a decent tool, oiled and kept. (Useful. Keep it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Since Stan died... I keep expecting to see Stan at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I rinse the cup twice at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Go on, then. I'll be thinking good thoughts at you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. Nobody's worked the north treeline by the fallen oak in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"This one — Biriba. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — The Iron Pantry, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "You show them Yarrow — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Water's almost gone — 9 liters. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 9 liters, 11 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"The Iron Pantry. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "Paisley nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "You show them Biriba — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 76,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "I don't pick sides. I pick the group. Every time."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"an old trapline — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Everyone's allowed a bad day. Nobody's allowed two in a row. My rule.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to keep the peace.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "Owen nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Right. Sorry, I go on about it. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Lorenzo keeps me sane. Everyone needs one person who'd notice if they stopped showing up.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get back to it. Good talking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — the need hasn't gone anywhere. I'm still asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"I still need help with the creek water run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Everyone's choosing sides and pretending they aren't. I hate it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"what's been happening — that's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "Jorge nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 83,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I've been writing letters I'll never send. I'm ashamed and I can't stop.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "On the way, Abdul stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Owen nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"They took you — Impress Us, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I taste the water before the others drink. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Omar: \"I've heard good things about Ashford. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Ashford."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 9 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Impress Us. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Abdul nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
