  "deathBeat": [
   "d30: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Grayson Boyd is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d30: 🕯️ Grayson Boyd is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d30: The village's quarrel was with Grayson — and Grayson is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d30: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Static Kite is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d31: That night, they bring Grayson home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [
   "d30: At the grave, Lorenzo, Paisley, Victor and 3 more speak for Lillian — \"Grayson trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
  ],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d30: ◈ SYSTEM: \"PALISADE: ONLINE. Pointy! The audience approves of pointy. Raiders will think twice — the ones that can think. Sleep easy, little ones. The walls are watching so you do not have to.\"",
   "d30: ◈ SYSTEM: \"The long game, little hoarders. A GRANARY. Stockpile 20,000 kcal, 500 wood and 2,000 kcal of PRESERVED food — food that WAITS. Smoke it, dry it, render it. The audience finds delayed gratification EXOTIC. So do stomachs, we are told.\"",
   "d30: 📺 SYSTEM: \"SEASON FINALE APPROACHES! Party cap raised to FIVE! Go out with a BANG! (Figuratively. Mostly.)\""
  ],
